# Allowlist: this repo is ~1.7 GB (venv/, archive/, proforma/artifacts/), and a
# build context is uploaded to the registry before anything is built. Ignore
# everything, then re-include only what an image needs. Add a path here when a
# new image needs it, rather than deleting the `*`.
*
!conclusion/demo/**
!conclusion/.streamlit/**
!conclusion/data/historical_data_5yrs_monthly.csv
!conclusion/data/historical_data_sitewise.csv
!conclusion/data/n70_backtest_dataset.csv
!conclusion/data/tunnel_length_with_wash.csv
!conclusion/requirements.txt
!proforma/data/opex/opex-data.csv

# Never, whatever an allowlist above might catch
**/__pycache__/
**/.env
**/secrets.toml
